# A real site, visited (cavekit-flash.md R4 and R8, T-578): the outcome is not this script's verdict but its record:
# whether the page offered a movie, by which player (the device's Flash, or Ruffle in the page), whether it drew,
# read from the daemon's log (show-log), the page itself (probe) and the kept picture; site-report.py makes the
# table by host. The script fails only when the page does not load (a site down is recorded as down, no verdict
# on Flash) or the daemon falls over (the runner sees that). the JW FLV Player's page of December 2010 as the Wayback Machine keeps it: the player's SWF archived
id: site-video-jwplayer
section: Flash
item: A real page with a Flash video player (the JW FLV Player's page of December 2010 as the Wayback Machine keeps it: the player's SWF archived): visited, its outcome recorded by host (tools/device/finger/flash/site-report.py); the daemon and the plugin stay up
shells: enyo mochi mojo
needs: internet
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true
page: https://web.archive.org/web/20101231205543/http://www.longtailvideo.com/players/jw-flv-player/
kit: cavekit-flash.md R8
wait quiet 'FATAL SIGNAL' 15
shoot page
show-log 'NPP_New \|NPP_SetWindow\|InstantiatePluginInstance rv\|palm draw:\|plugin lane open\|FATAL\|identity: \|loaderr failed=1'
probe what '(function(){function scan(d,o){if(!d)return;o.embeds+=d.querySelectorAll("embed,object").length;o.ruffle+=d.querySelectorAll("ruffle-player,ruffle-embed,ruffle-object").length;o.videos+=d.querySelectorAll("video").length;var f=d.querySelectorAll("iframe");for(var i=0;i<f.length;i++){var c=null;try{c=f[i].contentDocument}catch(e){}if(c)scan(c,o);else o.xframes.push((f[i].src||"").slice(0,70))}}var o={embeds:0,ruffle:0,videos:0,xframes:[]};try{scan(document,o)}catch(e){o.err=String(e)}var p=navigator.plugins["Shockwave Flash"];return JSON.stringify({flash:p?p.description:"none",embeds:o.embeds,ruffle:o.ruffle,rufflejs:!!window.RufflePlayer,videos:o.videos,err:o.err,title:document.title.slice(0,50),url:location.href.slice(0,80),xframes:o.xframes.slice(0,3)});})()'
